{
  "declaredLength": 6000,
  "decoding": "confirmed-per-slot-XOR-rotate3-index-seed",
  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "We meet again, my young friend! Today we’re\nfilming a kaiju movie!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 368,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005700650020006D00650065007400200061006700610069006E002C0020006D007900200079006F0075006E006700200066007200690065006E0064002100200054006F006400610079002000770065201900720065000A00660069006C006D0069006E0067002000610020006B00610069006A00750020006D006F007600690065002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "The story is this: An ancient Pokémon is brought\nback to life and goes on a rampage!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "In order to get the right feel, I need footage of the\nking of the ancient world—Tyrantrum!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "But I’m told the only way to accomplish this is by\npaying a small fortune for a fossil, then reviving it.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 884,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 110
    },
    {
      "displayText": "So that’s why I’ve been waiting for you!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1104,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0053006F00200074006800610074201900730020007700680079002000492019007600650020006200650065006E002000770061006900740069006E006700200066006F007200200079006F0075002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "If you ever manage to revive a Tyrunt from a fossil\nand evolve it into a Tyrantrum, please help us<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ncapture some footage of it!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1196,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 134
    },
    {
      "displayText": "If you agree to help us, I’ll even let you be in the\nfilm! As an extra, of course, but still!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "If you’re willing to help us out with the shoot,\nplease bring us a Tyrantrum.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1672,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No way are we gonna get this scene. We don’t\nhave the budget.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1836,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F0020007700610079002000610072006500200077006500200067006F006E006E00610020006700650074002000740068006900730020007300630065006E0065002E00200057006500200064006F006E20190074000A006800610076006500200074006800650020006200750064006700650074002E00100002011401950000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 66
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’ve never seen an ancient Pokémon before...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1968,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00492019007600650020006E00650076006500720020007300650065006E00200061006E00200061006E006300690065006E007400200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E0020006200650066006F00720065002E002E002E00100002011401960000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2068,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You really have a Tyrantrum with you?! Then can I\nassume you’re willing to help with the shoot?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2080,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Of course!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F006600200063006F007500720073006500210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Not interested",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F007400200069006E007400650072006500730074006500640000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Blast... I guess the only way to get the footage is\nfor me to dress up as a Tyrantrum!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I knew I could count on you! And don’t forget to\ngive it your all as an extra.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2520,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "All right, everyone, let’s do this! Lights... Camera...\nACTION!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2688,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006C006C002000720069006700680074002C002000650076006500720079006F006E0065002C0020006C006500742019007300200064006F0020007400680069007300210020004C00690067006800740073002E002E002E002000430061006D006500720061002E002E002E000A0041004300540049004F004E002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Wh-what is that?! Just there! Look!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00570068002D007700680061007400200069007300200074006800610074003F00210020004A00750073007400200074006800650072006500210020004C006F006F006B002100100002011401960000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "GRAOOOWWWR!!!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2904,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004700520041004F004F004F00570057005700520021002100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "What in the world is that?!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2932,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005700680061007400200069006E002000740068006500200077006F0072006C006400200069007300200074006800610074003F00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It’s...it’s a monster!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2988,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049007420190073002E002E002E0069007420190073002000610020006D006F006E007300740065007200210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It’s headed this way!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3036,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00490074201900730020006800650061006400650064002000740068006900730020007700610079002100100002011401950000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Prrrm! Prrrrrrmmm!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3088,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050007200720072006D002100200050007200720072007200720072006D006D006D00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "CUUUT!!!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3128,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043005500550055005400210021002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Come on, now’s not the time to try and get\ncuddles from your Trainer! What’re you trying to<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ndo, charm the audience?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3156,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 123
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Uh, Director? In spite of its fierce looks, I think\nTyrantrum actually can learn the move Charm.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 101
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I guess even that vicious temperament doesn’t\nstop it from being a cuddle bug with its Trainer!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "What?! Then that means it can’t be in the same\nscene as its Trainer!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 3808,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0057006800610074003F00210020005400680065006E002000740068006100740020006D00650061006E0073002000690074002000630061006E2019007400200062006500200069006E0020007400680065002000730061006D0065000A007300630065006E0065002000610073002000690074007300200054007200610069006E00650072002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "But wait, hold on a moment... An ancient\nPokémon forming a bond with a human...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 3956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Yes! Yes, I think that could work!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 4124,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00590065007300210020005900650073002C002000490020007400680069006E006B0020007400680061007400200063006F0075006C006400200077006F0072006B002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Are you sure, Director? I don’t think we’ve had a\nsingle shoot where we stuck to the script...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 4204,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Heh... Worry not!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 4404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004800650068002E002E002E00200057006F0072007200790020006E006F0074002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "The theme of our films is no longer “The Terrifying\nReality of Wild Pokémon”!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 4448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It is now “Coexisting with Wild Pokémon”!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 4612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004900740020006900730020006E006F00770020201C0043006F006500780069007300740069006E006700200077006900740068002000570069006C006400200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E201D002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "All our footage showing the heartwarming sides\nof Pokémon fits perfectly with this new theme!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 4704,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "And I daresay it’s a better fit for Lumiose than\nfocusing on the terror.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 4900,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Yes, this is going to be a huge hit... I can feel it!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 5056,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005900650073002C0020007400680069007300200069007300200067006F0069006E006700200074006F00200062006500200061002000680075006700650020006800690074002E002E002E00200049002000630061006E0020006600650065006C002000690074002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
      "displayText": "And we were able to make this pivot only due to\nyour help, my young friend! You have my thanks!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 5172,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿(",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 5372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00280000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "A movie series depicting coexistence with\nPokémon... It will be a hit! I’m sure of it!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 5384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’ve been playing along since he signs my\npaychecks, but I don’t think I’ll make it to stardom<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nworking with this director...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 5568,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 132
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tyrantrum is so cute! Actually, all Pokémon are\nreally adorable, in my opinion.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 5832,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    }
  ],
